<h1><span class="mw-headline" id="List_of_common_ERF_Files">List of common ERF Files</span></h1>
<p>ERF Files for Dragon Age Game Resources are stored in the (Dragon Age Install Dir)\packages\core\ Folder and Subdirectories. ERF's for Addons or Mods are usually in their respective Addon or Mod Folder.
</p><p>Common ERF's of certain interests are,
</p>
<ul><li>Game Resources
